NOTE ON CONTENT:
This repository contains a distilled summary of, and index to, official
Beijing University of Chemical Technology (BUCT) publications
(the undergraduate handbook, the undergraduate study guide, and the
College of Materials Science and Engineering course-selection manual).
The full text of those publications is NOT included here.

Copyright in the original documents belongs to BUCT. The content of this
repository is a non-official study summary provided for personal
reference only. No affiliation with, or endorsement by, BUCT is claimed.
If any rights holder objects, the material will be removed on request.
